<title>POLAND: Elektrim Q4 net rises to PLN 20.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Elektrim Q4 net rises to PLN 20.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektrim SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     25.12  vs    8.59 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 43.11  vs   26.78</p>
<p>    net profit			     20.83  vs    9.26</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Elektrim SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     256.13  vs  206.57</p>
<p>    costs of sales			207.96  vs  143.68</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.10  vs    0.01 loss</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     25.76  vs   11.36</p>
<p>    other taxes refund		    3.48  vs    6.16</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   76.03  vs   76.48</p>
<p>    financial costs			58.15  vs   41.10</p>
<p>    investment			    131.62  vs   99.73</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		     49.32  vs   30.36</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			197.05  vs  199.58</p>
<p>    net profit			     49.78  vs   51.86</p>
<p>    net sales			     905.08  vs  618.41</p>
<p>    costs of sales			767.72  vs  524.88</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.10  vs    0.01 loss</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     88.06  vs   70.75</p>
<p>    other taxes			    59.20  vs   76.96</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  327.12  vs  277.76</p>
<p>    financial costs		     179.50  vs  108.53</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
